[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0710","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0710.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-9042","title":"Kubernetes Kubelet Windows 命令注入漏洞","description":"Kubelet 是 Kubernetes 集群中运行在每个节点上的核心代理组件，负责管理容器生命周期。CVE-2024-9042 是 Kubelet 在 Windows 节点上的命令注入漏洞，由于对用户输入验证不充分（CWE-20），拥有集群管理权限的攻击者可通过特制请求向 Kubelet 注入恶意命令，在 Windows 工作节点上以 Kubelet 进程权限执行任意命令，导致节点被完全控制。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响 Windows 版本的 Kubernetes 工作节点，攻击复杂度较高且需要高权限，但一旦利用成功可导致节点机密性和完整性完全丧失。Microsoft 和 Kubernetes 社区已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2024-9042"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-13T17:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:23:50Z","remediation":"升级 Kubelet 到 v1.32.1 或更高版本以获取修复。如果无法立即升级，从防火墙禁用 Windows 节点入站网络流量或隔离受影响的节点作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/129654","https://groups.google.com/g/kubernetes-security-announce/c/9C3vn6aCSVg","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/16/1","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-9042.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2024/9xxx/CVE-2024-9042.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/k8s.io/kubernetes/CVE-2024-9042.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-9042","https://github.com/klts-io/website/blob/227a6395ea80131a21b3ad8068f6256e7eb2300f/content/en/docs/kubernetes/patches/cve-2024-9042.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2024/9xxx/CVE-2024-9042.json","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/bc76bf461beecebb7c648559b93e442ec7025acb/archive/2025/2025-12-11.md","https://github.com/awsdocs/amazon-eks-user-guide/blob/b1237fe9fa790cce9400145cc4e4ed4bddfa85eb/latest/ug/nodes/eks-ami-versions-windows.adoc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CVE-2024-9042-2025-04-05-2005","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2025-3522.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0710.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0710.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0692","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0692.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58089","title":"Linux Btrfs 双重记录竞争条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在 ordered extent（有序区间）记账过程中存在双重记账竞态条件漏洞。当 `btrfs_run_delalloc_range()` 因空间不足（-ENOSPC）等异常失败时，在块大小（4K）小于页大小（64K）的 aarch64 架构上，已分配的 ordered extent 可能被重复释放导致引用计数紊乱，进而触发内核空指针解引用和内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过触发特定写入路径利用该漏洞实施拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响所有使用 btrfs 且 sector size 与 page size 不匹配的 Linux 内核版本，已在主线内核中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58089"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-12T10:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:36Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至包含提交 72dad8e377afa（6.14-rc1 及以上）的版本，或更新至已修复的稳定版 6.12.17-1 及以上。对于使用 btrfs 文件系统的 aarch64 架构（块大小 4K、页大小 64K）环境，如无法立即升级内核，建议避免在 btrfs 上执行高并发延迟分配写入操作，或临时改用 xfs/ext4 文件系统作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0283ee1912c8e243c931f4ee5b3672e954fe0384","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/21333148b5c9e52f41fafcedec3810b56a5e0e40","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/72dad8e377afa50435940adfb697e070d3556670","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58089.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58089.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58089","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58089.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58089.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58089.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58089.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/06/seguranca/cve-2024-58089-btrfs-fix-double-accounting-race-wh-1765071579000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-7c9x-m5v8-vvj9/GHSA-7c9x-m5v8-vvj9.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2024-58089"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0692.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0691","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0691.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58088","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 释放 cgroup 存储时死锁漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统在释放 cgroup 存储（cgroup storage）时存在死锁漏洞。由于 `bpf_cgrp_storage_get` 在 map 释放路径中未正确传递繁忙计数器，导致在持有 local_storage 锁的情况下递归获取同一锁，形成死锁。本地低权限攻击者可通过加载特制的 BPF 程序（fentry 挂载到 cgroup_storage_ptr、tp_btf 触发存储访问）触发该条件，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中引入 BPF cgroup storage 的版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58088"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-12T10:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：6.6.80、6.12.17、6.13.5 或 6.14 及以上。对应修复提交为 c78f4afbd962、fcec95b4ab3e、fac674d2bd68、6ecb9fa14eec。RHEL 9 用户安装 RHSA-2025:20518 更新，SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:01964-1/01614-1/01951-1 更新。临时缓解措施：限制非特权用户加载 BPF 程序（kernel.unprivileged_bpf_disabled=1）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ecb9fa14eec5f15d97c84c36896871335f6ddfb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c78f4afbd962f43a3989f45f3ca04300252b19b5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fac674d2bd68f3479f27328626b42d1eebd11fef","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fcec95b4ab3e7bc6b2f36e5d59f7e24104ea87f7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58088.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58088","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58088.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58088.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58088.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58088.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/21/seguranca/cve-2024-58088-bpf-fix-deadlock-when-freeing-cgrou-1771669593000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-x4w2-gh57-r677/GHSA-x4w2-gh57-r677.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58088","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-58088.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0691.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0711","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0711.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-9157","title":"Synaptics 音频驱动 DLL 加载权限提升漏洞","description":"Synaptics 音频驱动中的 CxUIUSvc64.exe 和 CxUIUSvc32.exe 服务二进制文件存在 DLL 加载漏洞（CWE-284），允许拥有本地低权限的认证攻击者利用该服务在特权进程中加载恶意 DLL，从而实现权限提升。成功利用后可获取系统最高权限，完全控制目标主机的机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。需要注意的是，受影响的 Synaptics 音频驱动产品已停止维护（End-of-Life），官方建议用户移除该产品以避免安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-9157"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-11T17:16:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:24:03Z","remediation":"该产品已停止支持（End-of-Life），官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即卸载 Synaptics 音频驱动程序（CxUIUSvc64.exe / CxUIUSvc32.exe），或通过设备管理器禁用相关服务。如业务必须使用，可配置 Windows 强制签名策略（Enable LSA Protection）并限制非管理员用户安装 DLL 的目录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.synaptics.com/sites/default/files/2025-03/audio-driver-security-brief-2025-03-11.pdf","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-9157.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2024/9xxx/CVE-2024-9157.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2024/9xxx/CVE-2024-9157.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-9157","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-9157.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-fxhc-7857-mhjj/GHSA-fxhc-7857-mhjj.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-9157.html","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-9157","https://github.com/ghostbyt3/patch-tuesday/blob/931d6b17c9a96e09a1608b51a70921a5fbd38a65/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-9157.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0711.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0690","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0690.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58083","title":"Linux Kernel KVM 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 KVM 虚拟化子系统的 kvm_get_vcpu() 函数存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。该函数在通过索引获取 vCPU 时，未先验证目标 vCPU 是否已完全上线，而是先对索引进行 nospec 钳位处理。当传入非法索引时，钳位操作会返回 0，导致函数返回 vCPU0 而非 NULL。由于 KVM 使用 xarray 管理 vCPU 数组，vCPU 在创建完成前即被插入数组，若后续创建失败并释放 vCPU0，其他代码路径仍可能通过该函数访问已释放的 vCPU0，触发释放后使用。本地攻击者需具备低权限访问，可利用此漏洞导致系统崩溃或权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58083"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T17:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:35Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至包含 commit 3c1e4a1c 的版本：RHEL 9 升级至 RHSA-2025:20518 提供的 kernel 包；Ubuntu 18.04 LTS 安装 USN-7540-1 更新；Debian 11 应用 DLA-4178-1 内核更新；SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 SP6 安装 SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1 补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户对 KVM 虚拟化设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/09d50ccf0b2d739db4a485b08afe7520a4402a63","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/125da53b3c0c9d7f58353aea0076e9efd6498ba7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1e7381f3617d14b3c11da80ff5f8a93ab14cfc46","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5cce2ed69b00e022b5cdf0c49c82986abd2941a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7c4899239d0f70f88ac42665b3da51678d122480","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ca8da90ed1432ff3d000de4f1e2275d4e7d21b96","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d817e510662fd1c9797952408d94806f97a5fffd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f2f805ada63b536bc192458a7098388286568ad4","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58083.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58083.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58083","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58083.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58083.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58083.json","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58083/CVE-2024-58083.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58083.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58083-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-gw27-9x3h-33gj/GHSA-gw27-9x3h-33gj.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0690.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0689","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0689.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58076","title":"Qualcomm Linux 内核 SM6350 GCC 时钟驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Qualcomm GCC SM6350 时钟驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞，由于 clk_rcg2 结构体在定义了 parent 后未同步定义 parent_map，导致调用 clk_set_rate 时 qcom_find_src_index 函数访问空指针引发内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞触发拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58076"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T17:15:20Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:34Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.78、6.12.14、6.13.3 或 6.14 及以上版本，或从 kernel.org 合入修复 commit 08b77ed7cfaac（主线）及对应稳定分支补丁。Debian 用户安装 DLA-4102-1 更新，Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7511-1/USN-7510-1 更新。如无法立即升级，可限制本地低权限用户对时钟设备的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/08b77ed7cfaac62bba51ac7a0487409ec9fcbc84","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/175af15551ed5aa6af16ff97aff75cfffb42da21","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/39336edd14a59dc086fb19957655e0f340bb28e8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3e567032233a240b903dc11c9f18eeb3faa10ffa","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/96fe1a7ee477d701cfc98ab9d3c730c35d966861","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b6fe13566bf5676b1e3b72d2a06d875733e93ee6","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58076.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58076.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58076.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58076","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58076.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58076.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58076-2025-11-03-1400","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58076.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-j2pq-j692-qx87/GHSA-j2pq-j692-qx87.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58076-clk-qcom-gcc-sm6350-add-missing-par-1771406180000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0689.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0688","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0688.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58071","title":"Linux kernel team 子设备添加死锁拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 team 网络驱动中存在不正确的锁处理漏洞。当将已作为其他 team 设备下层端口的网络设备（如 VLAN 子接口）再次添加为 team 设备成员时，内核未进行充分检查，导致 team_lock_key 被递归加锁，引发死锁。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特定的网络设备配置序列触发此条件，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.13-rc2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58071"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T16:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:34Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下已修复版本：5.4.291、5.10.235、5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13 或 6.13.2 及以上。Debian 用户请参照 DLA-4178-1 和 DLA-4102-1 公告更新内核包。如无法立即升级，避免将已作为 VLAN/bridge 下层的网络设备添加到 team 接口中，防止触发递归锁死锁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a7794b9ca78c8e7d001c583bf05736169de3f20","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/184a564e6000b41582f160a5be9a9b5aabe22ac1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1bb06f919fa5bec77ad9b6002525c3dcc5c1fd6c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3fff5da4ca2164bb4d0f1e6cd33f6eb8a0e73e50","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/62ff1615815d565448c37cb8a7a2a076492ec471","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/adff6ac889e16d97abd1e4543f533221127e978a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bd099a2fa9be983ba0e90a57a59484fe9d520ba8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d9bce1310c0e2a55888e3e08c9f69d8377b3a377","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58071.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58071.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58071","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58071.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58071.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58071.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58071.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58071-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58071-team-prevent-adding-a-device-which--1771406440000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-3fpr-88w3-v99m/GHSA-3fpr-88w3-v99m.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0688.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0687","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0687.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58069","title":"Linux 内核 PCF85063 RTC 驱动越界写入漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 PCF85063 RTC 驱动中的 NVMEM 读取接口存在越界写入漏洞。nvmem 子系统支持可变缓冲区大小，而底层 regmap 接口使用固定大小的 unsigned int（4 字节）存储。当 nvmem 客户端使用小于 4 字节的缓冲区调用 regmap_read 时，regmap 会向缓冲区外写入数据，导致越界写入。本地攻击者可通过构造特定的 nvmem 访问请求触发此漏洞，造成系统内存损坏，进而实现权限提升或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响使用 PCF85063 RTC 芯片的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问条件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58069"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T16:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:33Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.4.291、5.10.235 或 5.15.179 及以上版本，这些版本已包含针对 PCF85063 RTC 驱动 NVMEM 读取越界写入的补丁。Debian 用户可参考 DLA-4102 和 DLA-4178 公告通过 apt update && apt upgrade 更新内核包。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户对 /dev/rtc 及相关 sysfs 接口的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/21cd59fcb9952eb7505da2bdfc1eb9c619df3ff4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ab8c5ed4f84fa20cd16794fe8dc31f633fbc70c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/517aedb365f2c94e2d7e0b908ac7127df76203a1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6f2a8ca9a0a38589f52a7f0fb9425b9ba987ae7c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9adefa7b9559d0f21034a5d5ec1b55840c9348b9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c72b7a474d3f445bf0c5bcf8ffed332c78eb28a1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e5536677da803ed54a29a446515c28dce7d3d574","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e5e06455760f2995b16a176033909347929d1128","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58069.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58069.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58069.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58069","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58069.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58069.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58069-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58069.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-p7j9-4392-6r7p/GHSA-p7j9-4392-6r7p.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58069-rtc-pcf85063-fix-potential-oob-writ-1771406401000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0686","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58063","title":"Linux kernel rtlwifi 驱动内存泄漏与无效访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 rtlwifi 无线网卡驱动在设备探测（probe）失败路径中存在内存泄漏和无效访问漏洞。当 init_sw_vars 初始化失败后，驱动错误地调用了 rtl_deinit_core 函数，该函数会销毁 rtl_wq 工作队列，导致后续对已销毁工作队列的访问引发无效内存访问。同时，未正确调用 rtl_pci_deinit 和 deinit_sw_vars 进行资源清理，造成内存泄漏。本地低权限攻击者可通过插入特定 Realtek 无线网卡设备触发 probe 失败路径，利用此漏洞造成系统拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58063"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T16:15:52Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:32Z","remediation":"更新 Linux 内核至包含以下提交的版本：`commit 8d450935ae7f`（移除不必要的 pci_set_drvdata）和 `commit 3d86b93064c7`（修复 probe 错误路径内存泄漏）。Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7540-1（18.04）、USN-7511-1（22.04）、USN-7640-1（20.04）或 USN-7653-1（22.04）安全更新；Debian 11 用户安装 DLA-4178 或 DLA-4102 更新。如无法立即更新，可禁用受影响 Realtek WiFi 设备（`modprobe -r rtlwifi`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/32acebca0a51f5e372536bfdc0d7d332ab749013","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/455e0f40b5352186a9095f2135d5c89255e7c39a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/624cea89a0865a2bc3e00182a6b0f954a94328b4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6b76bab5c257463302c9e97f5d84d524457468eb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/85b67b4c4a0f8a6fb20cf4ef7684ff2b0cf559df","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b96371339fd9cac90f5ee4ac17ee5c4cbbdfa6f7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e7ceefbfd8d447abc8aca8ab993a942803522c06","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ee0b0d7baa8a6d42c7988f6e50c8f164cdf3fa47","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58063.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58063.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58063.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58063","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58063.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58063.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58063.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58063-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-vp5v-47wj-p5r2/GHSA-vp5v-47wj-p5r2.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58063-wifi-rtlwifi-fix-memory-leaks-and-i-1771406303000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0685","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0685.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58058","title":"Linux kernel UBIFS 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 UBIFS 文件系统存在空指针解引用漏洞。在清除 slab 缓存时，所有内存中的 znode 被释放，导致 `c->zroot.znode` 被置为 NULL，此后若执行 TNC（Tree Node Cache）树的转储操作，程序将访问该空指针并触发内核空指针解引用。本地攻击者需具备本地低权限访问条件，可利用此漏洞导致内核拒绝服务（系统崩溃）。该漏洞影响使用 UBIFS 文件系统的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58058"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T16:15:52Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:16Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本之一：5.4.291、5.10.235、5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13 或 6.13.2 及以上。Ubuntu 用户可通过 apt upgrade linux-image-generic 安装最新内核，Debian 用户请参考 DLA-4178-1 和 DLA-4102-1 公告升级对应版本。若暂时无法升级内核，可避免在 UBIFS 挂载点上执行 slab cache 清理操作（如 echo 2 > /proc/sys/vm/drop_caches），以降低触发空指针解引用导致内核崩溃的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1787cd67bb94b106555ffe64f887f6aa24b47010","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a987950df825d0144370e700dc5fb337684ffba","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/40e25a3c0063935763717877bb2a814c081509ff","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/428aff8f7cfb0d9a8854477648022cef96bcab28","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6211c11fc20424bbc6d79c835c7c212b553ae898","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/77e5266e3d3faa6bdcf20d9c68a8972f6aa06522","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bdb0ca39e0acccf6771db49c3f94ed787d05f2d7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e01b55f261ccc96e347eba4931e4429d080d879d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58058.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58058.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58058.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58058","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58058.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58058.md","https://github.com/openharmony/security/blob/f47b282130050082f1bcf6813aaced4157bd1771/vulntest/SSTSTestcases/2025/07/CVE-2024-58058/TestCaseRule-CVE-2024-58058.yara","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58058.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58058-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/agent/blob/04ca3d7145f1fedbc9cc09cf4cc1d5921344bd16/res/CVE-2024-58058/prompt_file.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0685.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0684","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0684.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58055","title":"Linux kernel USB Gadget f_tcm 双重释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 USB 小工具 f_tcm（Target Core Module）驱动存在双重释放（Double Free）漏洞。该漏洞源于驱动在处理 SCSI 命令时过早释放了命令结构体内存，未等待感知状态（sense status）的完成回调。当攻击者通过本地权限触发 USB Gadget 存储功能时，已释放的内存可能被重复释放，导致内核内存损坏。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞实现权限提升或导致系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.x 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级为高。攻击需要本地用户权限，无需认证，成功利用可获取高完整性与机密性影响。Linux 内核上游已通过延迟释放命令至状态完成回调后修复此问题，各发行版（Ubuntu、Debian 等）已在安全更新中集成补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58055"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T16:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核到以下已修复版本：5.4.291、5.10.235、5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13 或 6.13.2 及以上版本。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4178-1 安全更新，Ubuntu 用户请安装 USN-7540-1（18.04）、USN-7640-1（20.04）或 USN-7653-1（22.04）更新。如无法立即升级，可在不影响业务的情况下禁用 USB Gadget 存储功能模块（f_tcm）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/16907219ad6763f401700e1b57b2da4f3e07f047","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/38229c35a6d7875697dfb293356407330cfcd23e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7cb72dc08ed8da60fd6d1f6adf13bf0e6ee0f694","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/929b69810eec132b284ffd19047a85d961df9e4d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bbb7f49839b57d66ccaf7b5752d9b63d3031dd0a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c225d006a31949d673e646d585d9569bc28feeb9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e6693595bd1b55af62d057a4136a89d5c2ddf0e9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f0c33e7d387ccbb6870e73a43c558fefede06614","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58055.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58055.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58055.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58055","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58055.json","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58055/CVE-2024-58055.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58055.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58055-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58055.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-q4g4-gmvw-9fqc/GHSA-q4g4-gmvw-9fqc.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0684.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0683","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0683.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58053","title":"Linux 内核 rxrpc 连接中断处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 rxrpc（RPC over Rx）协议模块存在拒绝服务漏洞。当内核接收到连接级别的中止信号时，虽然会设置传播标志，但不会唤醒该连接上的挂起调用来处理终止操作，导致这些调用因无后续输入而永久挂起。本地攻击者可在具备低权限条件下触发该连接中止，造成受影响的内核线程阻塞，导致系统资源耗尽或服务不可用。该漏洞影响使用 rxrpc 协议的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58053"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T16:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:31Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含修复补丁的版本：Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户需升级 linux-image 至 6.8.0-64-generic 或更高版本（通过 apt upgrade linux-image-generic-hwe-22.04）；SUSE 用户需应用 SUSE-SU-2025:02307-1 安全补丁。其他发行版请升级到对应的最新稳定内核版本。升级后必须重启系统使新内核生效。如暂无法升级内核，可考虑禁用 rxrpc 内核模块（rmmod af_rxrpc）作为临时缓解措施，但会影响 AFS 文件系统等依赖该模块的服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0e56ebde245e4799ce74d38419426f2a80d39950","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5842ce7b120c65624052a8da04460d35b26caac0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/96d1d927c4d03ee9dcee7640bca70b74e63504fc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9c6702260557c0183d8417c79a37777a3d3e58e8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58053.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58053.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-58053","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-58053.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58053.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58053.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-58053.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-fr55-grv4-g65r/GHSA-fr55-grv4-g65r.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2024-58053","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/a1261b7357f9786f5ac012655e9ba28ca9988b73/osv/AZL-68820.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0683.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0682","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58052","title":"Linux内核AMD GPU驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMD GPU 驱动（amdgpu）中的 `atomctrl_get_smc_sclk_range_table` 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞（CWE-476）。该函数在调用 `smu_atom_get_data_table()` 获取 SMU_Info 数据表时，未检查其返回值。若该调用失败并返回 NULL，后续代码将直接对空指针进行解引用操作，导致内核崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞仅在 Polaris 系列 GPU 芯片上存在可触发的代码路径，实际利用条件极为苛刻——正常运行时 VBIOS 数据表始终存在，因此在实际环境中极难触发。攻击者需具备本地权限才能构造特定条件触发此漏洞。Linux 内核已通过补丁添加返回值检查修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58052"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-06T16:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:31Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含该修复的稳定版本。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户可通过 `sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-image-generic` 升级至 5.15.0-1083 及以上版本；Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 用户升级至 5.4.0-1146 及以上版本。Debian/其他发行版用户应升级至包含上游补丁的内核版本。若无法立即升级内核，可考虑禁用 amdgpu 驱动作为临时缓解（在 GRUB 引导参数中添加 `modprobe.blacklist=amdgpu`），但这会影响 AMD GPU 图形和计算功能。建议通过各发行版官方仓库获取安全更新，而非手动编译内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0b97cd8a61b2b40fd73cf92a4bb2256462d22adb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2396bc91935c6da0588ce07850d07897974bd350","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/357445e28ff004d7f10967aa93ddb4bffa5c3688","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/396350adf0e5ad4bf05f01e4d79bfb82f0f6c41a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6a30634a2e0f1dd3c6b39fd0f114c32893a9907a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a713ba7167c2d74c477dd7764dbbdbe3199f17f4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ae522ad211ec4b72eaf742b25f24b0a406afcba1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c47066ed7c8f3b320ef87fa6217a2b8b24e127cc","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58052.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58052.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58052.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58052","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58052.json","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-58052/CVE-2024-58052.ql","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58052.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58052-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-58052.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-f33w-26qx-6hvm/GHSA-f33w-26qx-6hvm.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0682.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0522","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0522.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45782","title":"GNU GRUB2 HFS 文件系统堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 HFS 文件系统驱动在处理挂载操作时，未对用户提供的卷标名称长度进行有效校验，直接调用 `strcpy()` 将卷标复制到固定大小的堆缓冲区中，导致堆越界写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过挂载特制的 HFS 文件系统卷触发该漏洞，破坏 GRUB 的敏感数据完整性，最终绕过安全启动（Secure Boot）保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 GRUB2 的系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45782"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T17:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41Z","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至 2.12 以上版本（含已合入补丁的构建），或应用上游补丁 `417547c10410b714e43f08f74137c24015f8f4c3`，将 `grub-core/fs/hfs.c:382` 处的 `grub_strcpy()` 替换为 `grub_strlcpy()` 以限制拷贝长度。各发行版用户安装对应安全更新：RHEL 用户关注 RHSA 公告，Debian/Ubuntu 用户通过 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc grub-efi` 更新，更新后执行 `grub-install` 重新安装引导器。如无法立即更新，限制本地攻击者访问系统引导分区并启用 UEFI Secure Boot 配合 SBAT 策略阻止未签名 GRUB 加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45782","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345858","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45782.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45782.nopatch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/b8117fffa9486975f050b7b07cfad353ee71453e/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45782.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/g/grub2/grub2.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45782","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45782.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45782.md","https://github.com/seapath/meta-seapath/blob/479229566d9de44367de66249dba8ed29de7b8ff/recipes-bsp/grub/files/CVE-2024-45782_CVE-2024-56737.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45782.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0522.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0518","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0518.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45778","title":"GNU GRUB2 BFS文件系统解析器整数溢出漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 BFS 文件系统解析器存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），当解析特制的 BFS 文件系统时，整数溢出导致栈上出现无限循环，最终引发栈溢出使 GRUB2 崩溃。攻击者需具备本地高权限访问，通过挂载恶意构造的 BFS 文件系统触发该漏洞，造成系统引导阶段拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 GRUB2 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 4.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45778"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T17:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41Z","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至包含修复的版本：Ubuntu 24.04 升级至 grub2-unsigned 2.12-1ubuntu7.3 及以上，Ubuntu 20.04/22.04 升级至 2.06-2ubuntu14.8 及以上；RHEL 系列等待厂商安全更新。如无法立即更新，限制仅受信任用户访问系统引导加载程序，避免加载恶意构造的 BFS 文件系统镜像。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45778","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2345640","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45778.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45778.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/d5bf3451a732b5296c5b8cc86dbcb9121